props.description:
Rendered method for breadcrumbItem,
This method is called for all items except the last,
since, last item in breadcrumb will be the current page of user
@param item BreadcrumbItem
@returns ReactNode

Options in the group — can be:
 - string[] → converted to {label, value}
 - CheckboxGroupItem<T>[]

Extra class(es) applied to each `<tr>` in the body.
Pass a function to vary classes per row.
@example rowClass={(item, i) => item.active ? 'font-semibold' : ''}

